  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "\"Museum für Archäologie, Geologie und volkstümliche Bräuche. Anatomisches Museum (Léopold Ollier)\r\nSaal des Ökomuseums, Ausstellungen über den Olivenbaum\""
    ],
    "en": [
      "Situated in border of the former center of Les Vans, the museum is installed in the buildings of a former convent and a former silk spinning.\r\nThrough five exhibitions the museum reveals the various facets of a very contrasted territory but which forms a whole singular: Ardèche\r\nCévenne. The collections of geology, archaeology, ethnography and medicine make discover the nature, the culture or the personality of the\r\nmen who shaped this historic region. The establishment benefits from the label &quot;Museum of France&quot;.\r\nOpen to the contemporary initiatives, the museum organizes regularly temporary exhibitions and welcomes events: concert, reading,\r\nconference …"
    ],
    "it": [
      "Le esposizioni del museo rivelano le diverse sfaccettature delle Cévennes ardéchoises; le collezioni di geologia, archeologia, etnografia e medicina testimoniano la storia plurimillenaria di questo territorio contrastato."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Les expositions du musée dévoilent les différentes facettes des Cévennes ardéchoises ; les collections de géologie, d’archéologie, d’ethnographie et de médecine témoignant de l'histoire multi-millénaire de ce territoire contrasté."
    ],
    "es": [
      "Las exposiciones del museo revelan las diferentes facetas de las Cévennes ardéchoises; las colecciones de geología, arqueología, etnografía y medicina dan testimonio de la historia multimilenaria de este territorio de contrastes."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Dit museum telt vijf tentoonstellingen over een streek met veel contrasten: de Cévenne ardéchoise. De tentoonstellingen over geologie, archeologie, volkenkunde en anatomie vertellen alles over de natuur, maar ook de cultuur in de streek."
    ]
  },
